8 (n=47); Doncic vs LAC 0.733, -0.396 (n=30); Giannis forced PULL_UP 0.848, -0.540 vs preferred DRIVE (largest gap).", "auto_failure_mechanism": "E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)", "observed_failure_evidence": "No placebo or matching; later sequence work treated similar star-chain gaps as artifacts.", "observed_sample_and_power": "n>=30 for lineup cells cited", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED", "observed_method": "Jokic/Curry/Doncic/Giannis; min-15 gate on 8 play types; opposing DEFENSE_LINEUP ~84% coverage; 272-row CSV."}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:PLACEBO_DEPENDENCE"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-044", "label": "Study family SF-APPA-044: Oracle player matchup specificity on BEST counters (Route step)", "score": 0.191, "reached_via": ["request matches the question or hypothesis of FAM:SF-APPA-044 (0.16)", "request matches METH:matched_control (0.21); FAM:SF-APPA-044 auto_uses_method METH:matched_control"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Oracle player matchup specificity on BEST counters (Route step)", "auto_outcome_status": "supported", "observed_hypothesis": "The oracle BEST player for a counter play type varies by opponent, not a single team identity.", "observed_result": "64/78 (82%) (off, PT) cells have >1 oracle player across opponents; 19/78 dominated by one player (>=90%); median oracle-player entropy 0.928.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "D_positive (no failure: positive result)", "observed_failure_evidence": "82% of cells vary the oracle player by opponent.", "observed_sample_and_power": "n=6,852 oracle BEST possessions; 78 cells", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED", "observed_method": "_oracle_player_specificity.py; n=6,852 oracle BEST possessions; (off_team, play_type) cells."}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:small_sample"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER"}, {"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-APPA-045"}, {"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF06"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-074", "label": "Study family SF-APPS-074: Gravity persistence: elite creator -> teammate PPP at lags 1-3", "score": 0.18, "reached_via": ["request matches RQC:RQC-102 (0.23); FAM:SF-APPS-074 auto_addresses_question RQC:RQC-102", "request matches METH:matched_control (0.21); FAM:SF-APPS-074 auto_uses_method METH:matched_control"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Gravity persistence: elite creator -> teammate PPP at lags 1-3", "auto_outcome_status": "rejected", "observed_hypothesis": "After an elite creator's signature action, teammates score more on the team's next k possessions with the same lineup on the floor.", "observed_result": "All 8 creators horizon=0. Jokic lag-1 ATT=+0.0282 CI[-0.043,+0.099] p=0.3779. CLEAN NULL on teammate PPP. Secondary: Antetokounmpo +0.075 distinct initiators over next 3 poss (perm p=0.0002, BH 0.003) ? structure not eff [cut; read_family for the full text]", "auto_failure_mechanism": "B_powered_null (adequately powered null result)", "observed_failure_evidence": "No elite creator produces a positive lineup-matched teammate-PPP lift at any lag.", "observed_sample_and_power": "Jokic lag-1 n=1880; Giannis n=1804; Doncic n=325", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED", "observed_verdict": "null"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF30"}]}], "n_results": 4}

